From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NXForge layer <layer@nxforge.invalid>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 17:22:16 +0000
Subject: battery-saver: on the battery, a game nobody is playing pauses
 (DM_BATTERY_SAVER)

---
 docs/env_switches.tsv | 1 +
 docs/settings.md      | 1 +
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/docs/env_switches.tsv b/docs/env_switches.tsv
index b73a5196050ef4ea44d6fff7cb0f856e421208bd..2b1766cc9acbeb9b2d318e83d5e1a1cc74f1c6d7 100644
--- a/docs/env_switches.tsv
+++ b/docs/env_switches.tsv
@@ -21,6 +21,7 @@ DM_AUDIO_MUTE	switch	`=1` runs the real Core Audio output path (callback pacing,
 DM_AUDREN_RT	diagnostic	`0` keeps ordinary scheduling for the in-process audio renderer so its default real-time policy can be compared against it
 DM_AUDREN_TRACE	diagnostic	When set, the CPU audio renderer logs every update with the number of frames rendered since the previous one
 DM_AV1_DAV1D	switch	`=1` decodes AV1 movies with dav1d even where VideoToolbox decodes AV1 (Apple M3 and A17 Pro on), to compare the two or to check the path older chips take (`hle_movie_av1.c`)
+DM_BATTERY_SAVER	switch	`0` turns off Save battery on the Mac for a run: by default (and unless the sidebar's Save battery is off), a game running on the battery pauses while another app is in front and after ten minutes without input (NXForge, `dm/host/nxforge/front_mac_battery.inc`)
 DM_BOOTPROF	diagnostic	When set, logs boot timing: the loader's breakdown (mapping, relocation, probes), Metal library loading, pipeline creation, texture uploads and the first present
 DM_BUNDLE_ID	switch	Overrides the iOS app's bundle ID in `build_ipa.sh` (default `org.nxnative.<title ID in lowercase>`)
 DM_CHEATS	path	Folder of Atmosphère cheat files: `<folder>/<build ID>.txt` or an SD-card layout (`atmosphere/contents/<title ID>/cheats/`) under it (default `<DM_ROOT>/cheats`); the Mac menu lists and toggles them
diff --git a/docs/settings.md b/docs/settings.md
index 6f5ca01792349fdc9a8624ae6c20687cbcff7529..c4cec84d9a05860b815cd0afa9d984632d61a4bc 100644
--- a/docs/settings.md
+++ b/docs/settings.md
@@ -328,6 +328,7 @@ A Mac app also has a sidebar while the game runs: **Quick settings** (Esc, ⇧
 | Volume and mute | – | the slider and speaker at the top | – | `DMQuickSettings.volume.<game>`, `DMQuickSettings.muted.<game>` |
 | Pause the game, quieter sound while the sidebar is open | – | General | – | `DMQuickSettings.pauseOpen.<game>` (unset: on), `DMQuickSettings.duckOpen.<game>` |
 | Library keeps the game (a game NXForge's Play started): the sidebar's Library button pauses the game and hides it, and NXForge's Resume brings it back where it was; off, Library ends the game | – | General | – | `DMQuickSettings.keepLibrary.<game>` (unset: on) |
+| Save battery: unplugged, the game pauses while another app is in front and after ten minutes without input (`DM_BATTERY_SAVER=0` turns it off for a run) | – | General | – | `DMQuickSettings.batterySaver.<game>` (unset: on) |
 | Screenshot and recording folder | – | Capture | – | `DMQuickSettings.captureDir.<game>` (unset: the game folder) |
 | Mods that are on, and their load order | – | Mods | `DM_ROMFS_OVERLAY` replaces them | `DMQuickSettings.mods.<game>`, `DMQuickSettings.modOrder.<game>` |
 | Cheats that are on | – | Cheats (and the Cheats menu) | `DM_CHEATS_ON` | not in the preferences: `<build ID>.enabled` beside the cheat file |
